  "lines": [
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 0,
      "text": "272. Letters, Orders and Instructions. Oetober 17.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line000.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 1,
      "text": "2th. To Captain Peter Hogg, of the Virginia",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line001.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 2,
      "text": "Regiment.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line002.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 3,
      "text": "Slr",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line003.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 4,
      "text": "Treceived yours of the 6t. of Octo-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line004.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 5,
      "text": "ber, inclosing the Releurns of your Company,",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line005.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 6,
      "text": "only this day. Ferguson was sent after",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line006.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 7,
      "text": "you, but falling ill, by a Sore on his arm, was",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line007.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 8,
      "text": "ordered to halt here, where he now remain",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line008.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 9,
      "text": "unfit, for Duty: therefore I have sent",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line009.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 10,
      "text": "in his room. Sergeant Wilper has received",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line010.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 11,
      "text": "from Fort Cumberland and this place,",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line011.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 12,
      "text": "Arms and Clothing to complete your Compa-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line012.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 13,
      "text": "ny to the Establishment. He has enlisted",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line013.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 14,
      "text": "three men on his march, and I have or-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line014.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 15,
      "text": "dered Ensign Fleming, with eight others, to",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line015.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 16,
      "text": "join you; he being a Surgeon, he is desired to",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line016.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 17,
      "text": "take care of your Company; for which he",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line017.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 18,
      "text": "will be allowed. Your must use your best",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line018.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 19,
      "text": "endeavours to sebure your provisions, and do",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line019.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 20,
      "text": "with it as you see most needful:- Stisimpossi-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line020.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 21,
      "text": "ble Scan direct about it at this distance,",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line021.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 22,
      "text": "properly. As we have contracted for a",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line022.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 23,
      "text": "large quantity of Beef already, you are",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line023.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 24,
      "text": "desired to engage no more than what will",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line024.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 25,
      "text": "suffice for your own Company. I shall",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line025.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 26,
      "text": "see that money is lodged with Mr. Dick",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line026.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 27,
      "text": "for your use, when Bsee him- You are to",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line027.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 28,
      "text": "see the usual stoppages from the mens",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line028.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 29,
      "text": "pay while they are in the Hos pital, to",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line029.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 30,
      "text": "answer the expence of Wurses, c.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line030.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 31,
      "text": "You must be very careful not to slip.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line031.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 32,
      "text": "the opportunity of purchasing Grain for your",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line032.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 33,
      "text": "Company, that being your ouly dependance",
      "crop_path": "line_images/272/272_line033.png"
    }
  ]
}